# Code owners for code-scanner.
#
# When branch protection enables "Require review from Code Owners", a PR touching
# a matching path needs an approving review from one of the listed owners.
# Any single listed owner satisfies the requirement (not all of them), and an
# owner must have write access for their review to count. Add teammates here as
# they join — last matching rule wins, so put narrower rules below the global one.
#
# NOTE: external/outside collaborators (e.g. co-op contributors) are intentionally
# NOT listed here — their PRs must always be approved by a maintainer below.

